[TITLE]
SIM-16: pump PU1 with a speed pattern of 1, -1, 1
PU1 lifts water from R1 to J1. When the pump is off, reservoir R2 (head 50 ft)
supplies J1 through a check-valved pipe.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     100       ; gpm

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   0
 R2   50

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R2  J1  1000    12    100    0      CV

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R1  J1  HEAD C1  PATTERN SPEED1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow  Head
 C1  0     200
 C1  100   150
 C1  200   50

[PATTERNS]
;ID      Factors (hourly)
 SPEED1  1  -1  1        ; the second hour has a negative speed

[TIMES]
 Duration            2:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  1:00
 Pattern Timestep    1:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
